    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6274" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">callĭblĕphărum</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">callĭblĕphărĭ-um</span></b> ,
