				§ 102</span></i>. —Hence, † <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">callĭblĕphărātus</span></b> ,
				a, um, adj., <i>with
				beautiful eyelids</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ostrea,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					32, 6, 21, § 61</span></i>
			.</div>
